    "The 9-semester-hour concentration block depends on the student's chosen concentration; course-level lines are not fixed until one is selected. Digital Marketing Strategies: WEBD122, WEBD323, COMM255. Marketing Communication Strategy: MKTG304, MKTG305, COMM375. Marketing Decision Making: BUSN330, WEBD122, BUSN336. General Concentration: 9 semester hours from courses with prefixes ACCT, ANLY, BUSN, DEFM, ECON, ENTR, FINC, HOSP, HRMT, MGMT, MKTG, RLMT, RTMG, SCMG, TLMT not already used.",
